      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210220101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210220101": {
            "id": "210220101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...How many secrets does Liyue truly hold?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102290",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210229201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210229201": {
            "id": "210229201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229202"
            ]
          },
          "210229202": {
            "id": "210229202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Great. Hmm, but I should give you an idea of what to look for... Yes, keep your eyes peeled for stone pillars and stone tablets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229203"
            ]
          },
          "210229203": {
            "id": "210229203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Given how ancient these ruins are, any text we can hope to find will be written on stone, not paper.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229204"
            ]
          },
          "210229204": {
            "id": "210229204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "After all, stone is the oldest and most durable medium for written communication."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102202",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the Guili Assembly to search for an ancient stone tablet.",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210220201": {
            "id": "210220201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...How many secrets does Liyue truly hold?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102203",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210220301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210220301": {
            "id": "210220301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Find anything in the ruins?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229501"
            ]
          },
          "210229501": {
            "id": "210229501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I found five stone tablets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229502"
            ]
          },
          "210229502": {
            "id": "210229502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Great! Let's see... Ugh, these are all over the place. Let me see if I can work out the right order...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220302"
            ]
          },
          "210220302": {
            "id": "210220302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...Hmm, there's a lot of missing text here, so it's quite disjointed. Also, I'm still not sure on the order...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220303"
            ]
          },
          "210220303": {
            "id": "210220303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But anyway, this is my best guess. If I line up like this, it reads as follows:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220304"
            ]
          },
          "210220304": {
            "id": "210220304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"...In the beginning, when the people assembled to farm the land... A god named Guizhong descended, whose dominion was over Dust, and whose reach shrouded the skies for thousands of miles around...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220305"
            ]
          },
          "210220305": {
            "id": "210220305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"...The god laid down four commandments for the people... Then another god descended, whose dominion was over Geo, and who brought the people of Liyue to this place. Jointly they shepherded the people for their protection...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220306"
            ]
          },
          "210220306": {
            "id": "210220306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"...And the assembly was named Guili after the names of the two gods...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220307"
            ]
          },
          "210220307": {
            "id": "210220307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It seems to be the about history of the Guili Assembly. And of a god with power over dust, who watched over this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220308"
            ]
          },
          "210220308": {
            "id": "210220308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But it also mentions another god who came here at some point, and even brought some of their people with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220309"
            ]
          },
          "210220309": {
            "id": "210220309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Also, it seems to be saying that the name 'Guili,' as in Guili Assembly, came about by taking one syllable each from the names of these two gods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220310"
            ]
          },
          "210220310": {
            "id": "210220310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "How fascinating. In all the documents I've ever read, I've never come across any mention of two gods who coexisted peacefully... let alone who actively worked together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220311"
            ]
          },
          "210220311": {
            "id": "210220311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It seems they were more than just two allied gods — they were best friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220312"
            ]
          },
          "210220312": {
            "id": "210220312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But what happened to them? They can't have just... disappeared?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220313"
            ]
          },
          "210220313": {
            "id": "210220313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "And how was the Guili Assembly laid to waste so completely? With two gods watching over it, no disaster should have been quite so devastating. Natural or otherwise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220314"
            ]
          },
          "210220314": {
            "id": "210220314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Which means that whatever happened was beyond even the gods' power to withstand...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220315"
            ]
          },
          "210220315": {
            "id": "210220315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Traveler, could you keep looking for more clues? Unless I'm mistaken, there should be more stone tablets around here, just like the ones you have seen already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220316"
            ]
          },
          "210220316": {
            "id": "210220316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Maybe they will tell the story of what happened next...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220317"
            ]
          },
          "210220317": {
            "id": "210220317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "That which is recorded on these stone tablets seems to differ in some places from those in some documents.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220318"
            ]
          },
          "210220318": {
            "id": "210220318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "*sigh* So many legends, so many tellings... Which of these is the truth, I wonder..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102204",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
