            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "*sigh* So many legends, so many tellings... Which of these is the truth, I wonder..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102205",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210220501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210220501": {
            "id": "210220501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Ah, you're back. I was starting to wonder how much longer I'd have to wait. Found anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229601"
            ]
          },
          "210229601": {
            "id": "210229601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Two more stone tablets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229602"
            ]
          },
          "210229602": {
            "id": "210229602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Ooh, let me see!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229603"
            ]
          },
          "210229603": {
            "id": "210229603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"...and there they fought upon the Guili Plains, where black dust choked the heavens and a thousand rocks splintered...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229604"
            ]
          },
          "210229604": {
            "id": "210229604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Oh my... It appears to be saying that a battle once took place on the Guili Plains. And an enormous battle at that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229605"
            ]
          },
          "210229605": {
            "id": "210229605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "That must have been the battle in which the Guili Assembly fell. But as for this other passage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229606"
            ]
          },
          "210229606": {
            "id": "210229606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...It seems to have been written by someone who couldn't bring themselves to leave their home. So they stayed here. And what's more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210229607"
            ]
          },
          "210229607": {
            "id": "210229607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...There's treasure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220502"
            ]
          },
          "210220502": {
            "id": "210220502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "...Clearly you have a fondness for treasure. But you're not wrong, there is indeed treasure in the Guili Plains if this passage is to be taken literally.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220503"
            ]
          },
          "210220503": {
            "id": "210220503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "But then we have... \"Guizhong's Four Commandments shall guide those in generations to come who aspire to find it,\" followed by:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220504"
            ]
          },
          "210220504": {
            "id": "210220504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "\"Teach with wisdom, be bound by virtue, fortify the bones, unite in ambition — the convergence of these four shall be known as the 'Guili Assembly.'\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220505"
            ]
          },
          "210220505": {
            "id": "210220505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "How does one decipher that? I wouldn't know where to start.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210220506"
            ]
          },
          "210220506": {
            "id": "210220506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Let's head back to Wangshu Inn. I think we all need some downtime before we try to tackle the riddle of Guizhong's Four Commandments."
          }
        }
      }
    },
